  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023 CDK C4C (Charter for Change)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEFORD has an interest in promoting and advocating for Localisation of Aid through hosting Charter for Change (C4C) Secretariat Caritas Denmark (CDK) similarly has an interest in contributing towards advancing Localisation of Aid in Humanitarian and Development  CEFORD and Caritas Denmark believe that they can achieve more by working together and both have the necessary resources with respect to human resources and otherwise, to contribute meaningfully to such collaboration</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose and goal of the collaboration is to work towards promotion of Localisation Aid</narrative>
